  "name": "materials-new-crystal-generation",
  "description": "Orchestrate the DEMO (Diffusion-based Evolutionary Multi-objective Optimization) pipeline on MatterGen for inorganic crystal discovery. Use whenever the user wants to RUN/CONFIGURE/DEBUG/EXTEND the evolutionary loop, modify a running search (tighten constraints, down-rank structures, inject priors), inspect progress (Pareto front, population), evaluate a CIF, debug a stalled run, or explain a result. Triggers: \"跑一轮进化\", \"evolve 2D dielectric crystals\", \"find a ternary semiconductor with bandgap 1-2 eV\", \"kick off a run\", \"intervene mid-run\", \"inject domain knowledge\", or mentions of Evoloop / TriplePopCMOEA / StandardCDP / Pareto / MatterGen / MatterSim / JACS cl_score / cppred. Two remote HTTP MCP servers (FastMCP on mcp.example.internal:22222): mattergen MCP runs the entire loop; crystal-property-prediction MCP computes 9 properties per CIF. Claude runs no models locally and never SSHes.",
